{"channelId":"UCWN6Z_0FfesFBpOK6bJsTYA","row":["Palmetto Animal League Adoption Center",76,"Palmetto Animal League is a private, non-profit, no kill animal rescue organization that believes every animal deserves a second chance at life. PAL’s Adoption Center, located in Okatie’s Riverwalk Business Park, serves as a temporary residence for approximately 200 dogs and cats while they wait to find a loving home. This comfortable, upbeat facility is also home to PAL's Community Clinic, which offers spay/neuter, wellness exams, vaccines and other vital services to pet owners at affordable prices. In addition, Palmetto Animal League manages a network of loving foster families to house and care for abandoned animals. Remember to shop at the PAL Thrift Store in Sheridan Park where great buys save lives.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWN6Z_0FfesFBpOK6bJsTYA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWN6Z_0FfesFBpOK6bJsTYA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:46.956Z","channelId":"UCWN6Z_0FfesFBpOK6bJsTYA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"ac34e61772d66e3722971e1801f8322a705c2587b1ba8e9185ee118aaa983688","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"c46352eec193aceb5fc4c66b4d89682d834d65a4b57474b3b11f4e5fd1ac6e85"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWN6Z_0FfesFBpOK6bJsTYA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":76,"raw":"76 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWN6Z_0FfesFBpOK6bJsTYA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:46.956Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"organization_self_report","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWN6Z_0FfesFBpOK6bJsTYA"]}],"cleanup":{"status":"keep","code":"biography_audience_admitted","re